O --> A[Account SCP<br/>CloudTrail and IAM only]:::warning
A --> I{S3 inside every<br/>SCP allowance?}:::decision
P[IAM policy<br/>Allows s3:CreateBucket]:::inputData --> I
I -->|No| D[CreateBucket denied]:::output
N[No other account-level<br/>SCP supplies an S3 allow]:::warning -. decisive assumption .-> A
